@startuml
title Varan MIS - Authentication and Authorization

actor User
participant Browser
participant "Django auth" as Auth
participant "production.permissions" as Perm
participant "View" as View

User -> Browser : request protected URL
Browser -> Auth : session cookie
alt not authenticated
  Auth -> Browser : redirect to login
else authenticated
  Auth -> Perm : check groups/superuser
  alt allowed
    Perm -> View : continue
    View -> Browser : render response
  else denied
    Perm -> Browser : return forbidden/redirect
  end
end

note right of Perm
Roles:
Admin, Registrar, Viewer.
Superuser is treated as Admin.
end note

@enduml
